<h1 data-copy-en="Vera" data-copy-zh="Vera">Vera</h1>
<p class="starter-description" data-copy-en="Track net winnings, relationship milestones and separate hotel activities." data-copy-zh="查看净赢额、关系进展与两种独立的旅馆活动。">Track net winnings, relationship milestones and separate hotel activities.</p>
<div class="wiki-source-line"><span data-copy-en="v1.0_BETAx · Updated 9 November 2026" data-copy-zh="v1.0_BETAx · 2026 年 11 月 9 日更新">v1.0_BETAx · Updated 9 November 2026</span></div></div></section>
<section class="section wiki-reading-section"><div class="container wiki-reading-layout">
<aside class="wiki-toc"><div class="wiki-toc-inner"><button aria-expanded="false" class="wiki-toc-toggle" data-wiki-toc-toggle="" type="button"><span data-copy-en="On this page" data-copy-zh="本页目录">On this page</span><span aria-hidden="true">+</span></button><p class="wiki-toc-heading" data-copy-en="On this page" data-copy-zh="本页目录">On this page</p><div class="wiki-toc-links" data-lang-panel="en" data-wiki-toc-links=""><a class="wiki-toc-h2" href="#en-overview">Overview</a><a class="wiki-toc-h2" href="#en-location">Where to find them</a><a class="wiki-toc-h2" href="#en-route">Route and relationship milestones</a><a class="wiki-toc-h2" href="#en-activities">Activities and rewards</a><a class="wiki-toc-h2" href="#en-troubleshooting">What usually blocks the next step</a><a class="wiki-toc-h2" href="#en-related">Related guides</a></div><div class="wiki-toc-links" data-lang-panel="zh" data-wiki-toc-links="" hidden="" lang="zh-CN"><a class="wiki-toc-h2" href="#zh-overview">概览</a><a class="wiki-toc-h2" href="#zh-location">去哪里找</a><a class="wiki-toc-h2" href="#zh-route">路线与关系进展</a><a class="wiki-toc-h2" href="#zh-activities">行动与奖励</a><a class="wiki-toc-h2" href="#zh-troubleshooting">卡住时检查什么</a><a class="wiki-toc-h2" href="#zh-related">相关指南</a></div></div></aside>
<article class="wiki-article"><div class="wiki-source-content wiki-source-content-en" data-lang-panel="en" lang="en"><section id="en-overview"><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="Credits_and_Current_Scope"></span><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="Intimacy_Gallery"></span><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="Night_with_Vera:_current_availability_limitation"></span><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="Back_to_the_Hotel"></span><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="Hotel_Content"></span><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="Boardwalk_Date"></span><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="When_the_Tables_Turn"></span><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="Cards_and_Confidence"></span><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="Heart-to-Heart_Conversations"></span><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="Recommended_Progression_and_Personal_Events"></span><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="Net_Gambling_Winnings"></span><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="Overview"></span><h2>Overview</h2><figure class="reviewed-screenshot" style="max-width: 256px"><a aria-label="View full screenshot: Vera — character portrait." href="../assets/images/wiki/profiles/vera.webp" rel="noopener" target="_blank"><img alt="Vera — character portrait." decoding="async" height="175" loading="lazy" src="../assets/images/wiki/profiles/vera.webp" width="175"/></a><figcaption>Vera — character portrait.</figcaption></figure><p>Vera’s route uses both affection and your cumulative net bar-game winnings. Her lessons, two conversations, date and two hotel activities have separate gates.</p></section>
<section id="en-location"><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="Stats_and_Schedule"></span><h2>Where to find them</h2><p>Find her at Downtown Bar, daily 20:00–02:59. The separate hotel invitation starts at Romantic Retreat Hotel, 20:00–23:59.</p></section>
<section id="en-route"><h2>Route and relationship milestones</h2><p>Net winnings means tracked winnings minus tracked losses across all four bar games, not your current wallet or one large winning round. Drinks, skill fees and hotel expenses do not count as gambling losses.</p><p>Visit for The Downtown Bar. The following scenes need both their affection stage and net winnings shown below. Complete When the Tables Turn before the final scene. The earlier Cards and Confidence and boardwalk date are optional for the automatic scene chain.</p><table><thead><tr><th scope="col">Automatic scene</th><th scope="col">Location / start window</th><th scope="col">Requirements</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><th scope="row">The Downtown Bar</th><td data-label="Location / start window">Downtown Bar</td><td data-label="Requirements"></td></tr><tr><th scope="row">The Tell</th><td data-label="Location / start window">Downtown Bar</td><td data-label="Requirements">Acquaintance (50); after The Downtown Bar; net bar-game winnings $800</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">Bad Night</th><td data-label="Location / start window">Downtown Bar</td><td data-label="Requirements">Friend (100); after The Tell; net bar-game winnings $1,200</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">Crossing the Line</th><td data-label="Location / start window">Downtown Bar</td><td data-label="Requirements">Close Friend (200); after Bad Night; net bar-game winnings $1,800</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">Last Card</th><td data-label="Location / start window">Downtown Bar</td><td data-label="Requirements">Romantic (800); after Crossing the Line / When the Tables Turn; net bar-game winnings $4,000</td></tr></tbody></table><table><thead><tr><th scope="col">Action</th><th scope="col">Requirements / start window</th><th scope="col">Cost / recovery</th><th scope="col">Reward / limit</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><th scope="row">Cards and Confidence</th><td data-label="Requirements / start window">Known (25); net bar-game winnings $500</td><td data-label="Cost / recovery">60 min; $100; 15 Energy</td><td data-label="Reward / limit">once</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">When the Tables Turn</th><td data-label="Requirements / start window">Crush (400); net bar-game winnings $2,500</td><td data-label="Cost / recovery">180 min; $600; 50 Energy; 30 Calm</td><td data-label="Reward / limit">once</td></tr></tbody></table><p>At Romantic (800), Back to the Hotel needs $3,000 net winnings, while the separate Night with Vera needs $5,000. Each costs $500, takes 180 minutes, has its own daily use and needs content access. The first starts from her bar portrait and gives 40 base affection; the second starts at the Love Hotel and awards affection through its conversation choices.</p><p>Boardwalk Date needs Friend (100), starts 20:00–22:59 and is a one-time date. It does not require Diane’s boardwalk construction in its current conditions.</p></section>
<section id="en-activities"><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="Ordinary_Actions_and_Lessons"></span><h2>Activities and rewards</h2><table><thead><tr><th scope="col">Action</th><th scope="col">Requirements / start window</th><th scope="col">Cost / recovery</th><th scope="col">Reward / limit</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><th scope="row">Drink with Vera</th><td data-label="Requirements / start window">during the portrait schedule</td><td data-label="Cost / recovery">20 min; $20; 10 Energy</td><td data-label="Reward / limit">+1 base affection; 3/day</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">Learn Cheating</th><td data-label="Requirements / start window">Friend (100)</td><td data-label="Cost / recovery">180 min; $350; 30 Energy; 30 Calm</td><td data-label="Reward / limit">+20 base affection; learn Cheating once</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">Learn Seduction</th><td data-label="Requirements / start window">Close Friend (200)</td><td data-label="Cost / recovery">200 min; $400; 40 Energy; 40 Calm</td><td data-label="Reward / limit">+20 base affection; learn Seduction once</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">Bar Game Psychology</th><td data-label="Requirements / start window">Known (25); Communication 50</td><td data-label="Cost / recovery">30 min</td><td data-label="Reward / limit">+8 direct affection; Luck +1; once</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">Play Darts</th><td data-label="Requirements / start window">Stranger (0)</td><td data-label="Cost / recovery">30 min; $50</td><td data-label="Reward / limit">20/day</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">Boardwalk Date</th><td data-label="Requirements / start window">Friend (100); 20:00–22:59</td><td data-label="Cost / recovery">120 min; $50; 30 Energy</td><td data-label="Reward / limit">once</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">Back to the Hotel</th><td data-label="Requirements / start window">Romantic (800); net bar-game winnings $3,000; content access indicated by the lock</td><td data-label="Cost / recovery">180 min; $500; 50 Energy; 20 Calm</td><td data-label="Reward / limit">+40 base affection; 1/day</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">Night with Vera</th><td data-label="Requirements / start window">Romantic (800); net bar-game winnings $5,000; 20:00–23:59; content access indicated by the lock</td><td data-label="Cost / recovery">180 min; $500; 65 Energy</td><td data-label="Reward / limit">1/day; affection follows the conversation choices</td></tr></tbody></table><p>Cheating and Seduction are separate learned skills. Use the Bar Games guide for the four games, stakes and net-winnings tracking rather than treating every wager as guaranteed progress.</p><p>Favorite stats are Attractiveness, Charm, Stamina. The learned Perfect Metabolism skill improves her relationship bonus.</p><p>Start times are shown; the ending hour is excluded. Base affection receives the relationship bonuses, while direct affection is added as listed. Ordinary affection, player Erotic Experience and NPC intimacy experience are separate.</p></section>
<section id="en-troubleshooting"><h2>What usually blocks the next step</h2><ul><li>If a scene is missing, check net winnings and affection independently. Losing later games can put you below a threshold again.</li><li>The final scene needs Romantic, $4,000 net winnings and When Tables Turn.</li><li>For Night with Vera, go to the Love Hotel before midnight; it is not another bar-portrait action.</li><li>Boardwalk Date is one-time. The two hotel activities have separate daily allowances.</li></ul></section>
<section id="en-related"><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="Related_Pages"></span><h2>Related guides</h2><ul><li><a href="game-systems-bar-games.html">Games and net winnings</a></li><li><a href="game-systems-relationships-dating-and-intimacy.html">Relationship bonuses</a></li><li><a href="skills.html">Cheating and Seduction</a></li><li><a href="locations.html">Travel locations</a></li></ul></section>
</div><div class="wiki-source-content wiki-source-content-zh" data-lang-panel="zh" hidden="" lang="zh-CN"><section id="zh-overview"><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="zh-Credits_and_Current_Scope"></span><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="zh-Intimacy_Gallery"></span><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="zh-Night_with_Vera:_current_availability_limitation"></span><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="zh-Back_to_the_Hotel"></span><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="zh-Hotel_Content"></span><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="zh-Boardwalk_Date"></span><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="zh-When_the_Tables_Turn"></span><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="zh-Cards_and_Confidence"></span><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="zh-Heart-to-Heart_Conversations"></span><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="zh-Recommended_Progression_and_Personal_Events"></span><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="zh-Net_Gambling_Winnings"></span><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="zh-Overview"></span><h2>概览</h2><figure class="reviewed-screenshot" style="max-width: 256px"><a aria-label="查看完整截图：Vera 的角色头像。" href="../assets/images/wiki/profiles/vera.webp" rel="noopener" target="_blank"><img alt="Vera 的角色头像。" decoding="async" height="175" loading="lazy" src="../assets/images/wiki/profiles/vera.webp" width="175"/></a><figcaption>Vera 的角色头像。</figcaption></figure><p>Vera的路线同时看好感和酒吧游戏累计净赢额。技能课、两次交心对话、约会与两种旅馆活动各有条件。</p></section>
<section id="zh-location"><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="zh-Stats_and_Schedule"></span><h2>去哪里找</h2><p>每天20:00—02:59可在市中心酒吧找到她。另一项旅馆邀请从浪漫幽会酒店开始，时段为20:00—23:59。</p></section>
<section id="zh-route"><h2>路线与关系进展</h2><p>净赢额是四种酒吧赌局累计赢额减去累计输额，不是当前钱包余额，也不是单局最高收入。买酒、学技能和旅馆费用不算赌局输额。</p><p>先到访进行市中心酒吧，之后按下表同时满足好感与净赢额。最终事件要求完成当形势逆转时；较早的纸牌与自信和木板路约会不是自动事件链的必经步骤。</p><table><thead><tr><th scope="col">自动事件</th><th scope="col">地点／开始时段</th><th scope="col">条件</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><th scope="row">市中心酒吧</th><td data-label="地点／开始时段">市中心酒吧</td><td data-label="条件"></td></tr><tr><th scope="row">破绽</th><td data-label="地点／开始时段">市中心酒吧</td><td data-label="条件">相识（50）；完成：市中心酒吧；酒吧游戏净赢额$800</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">糟糕的夜晚</th><td data-label="地点／开始时段">市中心酒吧</td><td data-label="条件">朋友（100）；完成：破绽；酒吧游戏净赢额$1,200</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">越过界线</th><td data-label="地点／开始时段">市中心酒吧</td><td data-label="条件">亲密朋友（200）；完成：糟糕的夜晚；酒吧游戏净赢额$1,800</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">最后一张牌</th><td data-label="地点／开始时段">市中心酒吧</td><td data-label="条件">浪漫感（800）；完成：越过界线、当形势逆转时；酒吧游戏净赢额$4,000</td></tr></tbody></table><table><thead><tr><th scope="col">行动</th><th scope="col">条件／开始时段</th><th scope="col">消耗／恢复</th><th scope="col">奖励／次数</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><th scope="row">纸牌与自信</th><td data-label="条件／开始时段">已知（25）；酒吧游戏净赢额$500</td><td data-label="消耗／恢复">60分钟；$100；15精力</td><td data-label="奖励／次数">仅一次</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">当形势逆转时（菜单：形势逆转时）</th><td data-label="条件／开始时段">迷恋（400）；酒吧游戏净赢额$2,500</td><td data-label="消耗／恢复">180分钟；$600；50精力；30镇定</td><td data-label="奖励／次数">仅一次</td></tr></tbody></table><p>浪漫感（800）后，回到旅馆要求$3,000净赢额，独立的与 Vera 共度夜晚则要求$5,000。两项各花$500、180分钟，各有每天一次的次数及内容权限。前者从酒吧头像开始，给予40基础好感；后者从浪漫幽会酒店开始，好感按对话选择结算。</p><p>海滨步道约会要求朋友（100），20:00—22:59开始，仅一次；目前条件不要求Diane先完成木板路建设。</p></section>
<section id="zh-activities"><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="zh-Ordinary_Actions_and_Lessons"></span><h2>行动与奖励</h2><table><thead><tr><th scope="col">行动</th><th scope="col">条件／开始时段</th><th scope="col">消耗／恢复</th><th scope="col">奖励／次数</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><th scope="row">与Vera喝酒</th><td data-label="条件／开始时段">头像出现时</td><td data-label="消耗／恢复">20分钟；$20；10精力</td><td data-label="奖励／次数">基础好感+1；每天3次</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">学习作弊</th><td data-label="条件／开始时段">朋友（100）</td><td data-label="消耗／恢复">180分钟；$350；30精力；30镇定</td><td data-label="奖励／次数">基础好感+20；学习作弊，仅一次</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">学习诱惑</th><td data-label="条件／开始时段">亲密朋友（200）</td><td data-label="消耗／恢复">200分钟；$400；40精力；40镇定</td><td data-label="奖励／次数">基础好感+20；学习诱惑，仅一次</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">酒吧游戏心理学</th><td data-label="条件／开始时段">已知（25）；沟通50</td><td data-label="消耗／恢复">30分钟</td><td data-label="奖励／次数">直接好感+8；运气+1；仅一次</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">玩飞镖</th><td data-label="条件／开始时段">陌生人（0）</td><td data-label="消耗／恢复">30分钟；$50</td><td data-label="奖励／次数">每天20次</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">海滨步道约会</th><td data-label="条件／开始时段">朋友（100）；20:00–22:59</td><td data-label="消耗／恢复">120分钟；$50；30精力</td><td data-label="奖励／次数">仅一次</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">回到旅馆</th><td data-label="条件／开始时段">浪漫感（800）；酒吧游戏净赢额$3,000；满足锁形提示所示的内容权限</td><td data-label="消耗／恢复">180分钟；$500；50精力；20镇定</td><td data-label="奖励／次数">基础好感+40；每天1次</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">与 Vera 共度夜晚</th><td data-label="条件／开始时段">浪漫感（800）；酒吧游戏净赢额$5,000；20:00–23:59；满足锁形提示所示的内容权限</td><td data-label="消耗／恢复">180分钟；$500；65精力</td><td data-label="奖励／次数">每天1次；好感按对话选择结算</td></tr></tbody></table><p>作弊与诱惑是分别学习的技能。四种游戏、赌注和净赢额计算详见酒吧游戏指南，下注并不保证推进进度。</p><p>偏好的属性为吸引力、魅力、耐力。学会完美代谢可提高关系加成。</p><p>表中均为开始时间，不包含结束整点。基础好感受关系加成影响，直接好感按所列数值增加。普通好感、玩家情趣经验和NPC亲密经验分别计算。</p></section>
<section id="zh-troubleshooting"><h2>卡住时检查什么</h2><ul><li>事件未出现时，分别检查净赢额与好感；之后输掉赌局仍可能跌回门槛以下。</li><li>最终事件要求浪漫感、$4,000净赢额及当形势逆转时。</li><li>与 Vera 共度夜晚要在午夜前到浪漫幽会酒店，不是另一项酒吧头像行动。</li><li>木板路约会只进行一次，两种旅馆活动各有独立每日次数。</li></ul></section>
<section id="zh-related"><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="zh-Related_Pages"></span><h2>相关指南</h2><ul><li><a href="game-systems-bar-games.html">游戏与净赢额</a></li><li><a href="game-systems-relationships-dating-and-intimacy.html">关系加成</a></li><li><a href="skills.html">作弊与诱惑</a></li><li><a href="locations.html">交通地点</a></li></ul></section>
